  "body": "Mornings start close to the sand. Evenings finish on a large deck, doors open and the table full. This is life at 7 Kowhai Road, a completely renovated family home in one of Mairangi Bay’s most sought after pockets.\r\n\r\nInside, the renovation is complete and the palette is warm, layered and calm. Beautiful flooring and lighting run throughout. The kitchen sets the tone, with marble benchtops, warm white cabinetry and a well considered walk in pantry. Two living areas and a separate dining room give the family space to gather, or to scatter.\r\n\r\nThe master suite is a retreat in its own right, with a walk in wardrobe and a bespoke ensuite. Three further double bedrooms and an office off the double garage give everyone a place of their own.\r\n\r\nElevated and private, with tidy low maintenance gardens and glimpses of the sea. The village and the beach are close by, and the schooling is a draw in itself, with Mairangi Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College and both Westlake high schools in zone.\r\n\r\nDouble garaging and two additional off street parks.\r\n\r\nFound. Refined. Finished.\r\nWho lives in a home like this? You do.\r\n\r\nContact Jackie Parker or Kristina Marmont from PARKER | MARMONT New Zealand Sotheby’s International Realty for more information. \r\n\r\nAll conjunctionals welcome.",
